Subject: [PATCH 37/47] Finder: AirDrop folders (sent as .zip)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Share › AirDrop now appears for folders too. omdrop sends files only, so
each folder is zipped first (in the runtime directory, cleared at
logout) and goes as Folder.zip, which iPhones and Macs open with a tap.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
